<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 52-5 AT CLOSE V NEW ZEALAND (155), FIRST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 52-5 AT CLOSE V NEW ZEALAND (155), FIRST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, replying to</p>
<p>New Zealand's first innings total of 155, were 52 for five at</p>
<p>the close on opening day of the first test on Thursday.</p>
</text>
